# False positives confirmed 2026-07-31: Trivy's summary vulnerability table
# reports these as installed at the pre-fix versions (msgpack 1.1.2,
# setuptools 70.3.0), but the same scan's own per-file dist-info listing
# shows only msgpack-1.2.1 and setuptools-83.0.0 in the image (both clean).
# Reproduced identically across Trivy v0.70.0 and v0.72.0, so it isn't a
# scanner-version bug -- looks like a DB/matcher issue specific to these two
# advisories. requirements.txt pins msgpack>=1.2.1 / setuptools>=78.1.1
# (see 05d8748), and the Dockerfile build logs confirm those versions
# actually install. Revisit and remove this ignore if it's still needed
# after 2026-09-30 -- by then either the DB issue should be fixed upstream
# or this needs a fresh look.
